sky thank god I'm plowing."

613
00:32:59.144 --> 00:32:59.142
Who's that one I wonder?

614
00:32:59.144 --> 00:33:01.278
"Ease my pain
i work so well dumb down."

615
00:33:01.280 --> 00:33:01.979
Oh!

616
00:33:01.981 --> 00:33:01.979
Who knows?

617
00:33:01.981 --> 00:33:03.580
