648
00:33:34.046 --> 00:33:36.246
They're talking and--
oh, get me out of here!

649
00:33:36.248 --> 00:33:36.246
Get me out of here!

650
00:33:36.248 --> 00:33:39.416
"I was in the
barn happy and willing 'till I

651
