Who said anything
about Davy Crockett?

756
00:37:41.727 --> 00:37:43.793
I don't care about
Davy Crockett.

757
00:37:43.795 --> 00:37:50.367
I'm talking about those two guys
in grandpa's barn right now.

758
00:37:50.369 --> 00:37:51.534
Whit, listen.

759
00:37:51.536 --> 00:37:53.069
