a giant and its talking ox?

761
00:37:57.676 --> 00:38:00.343
Talking blue ox.

762
00:38:00.345 --> 00:38:03.780
Blue ox.

763
00:38:03.782 --> 00:38:06.116
Babe's hurt, and,
well, you're really

764
